    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This looks to me like a problem with python, not lavaan.<div><br></div><div>The error is being thrown in this file: <a href=\"http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc-2.4/html/_modules/rpy2/robjects/packages.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc-2.4/html/_modules/rpy2/robjects/packages.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423322659000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ymVoVbFlppQRAdK05ugOT\">http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc-2.4/html/_modules/rpy2/robjects/packages.html</a> (it appears), at the line that says:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">        </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">env</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">_get_namespace</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">rname</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(238,255,204)\">\r\n</span><br></div><div>Further up, it says:</div><div><pre style=\"overflow:auto hidden;padding:5px;background-color:rgb(238,255,204);color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:15.6px;border-top:1px solid rgb(170,204,153);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(170,204,153);border-left:none;border-right:none\"><span>_get_namespace</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\">=</span> <span>rinterface</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\">.</span><span>baseenv</span><span>[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&#39;getNamespace&#39;</span><span>]</span>\r\n</pre>So that&#39;s not working. The python package maintainer might be able to help. You might want to say what the runtime error actually is. </div><div><br></div><div>Jeremy</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
